rce image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Psionics:_Jump\" title=\"Githyanki Psionics: Jump\">Githyanki Psionics: Jump</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Jump\">Creatures with Jump</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Darkening_Hunt\" title=\"The Darkening Hunt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/30px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/45px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/60px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Darkening Hunt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/30px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Darkening_Hunt\" title=\"The Darkening Hunt\">The Darkening Hunt</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LONG_JUMP</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Astral_Gravity\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Gravity_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Gravity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Gravity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Gravity_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Gravity (Condition)\">Astral Gravity</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Gravity on the Astral Plane is different than on Faerûn.</li>\n<li>The affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a> and its <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is tripled.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Carrying_capacity\" title=\"Carrying capacity\">Carrying capacity</a> is tripled.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Jump\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Condition)\" title=\"Jump (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a>